All offsets (`MODPROBE_PATH_OFF`, `MSG_MSG_M_TS_OFF`, etc.) and the kernel base are placeholders — fill them for the specific target kernel build. The OOB write/leak steps are stubbed where the UAF write primitive would be applied.
